   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "text": "over the per-request limit\nis NOT a refusal — it is an\nescalation, parked on chain\nwith a TTL\n\ndenial, expiry and a failed\nverification are each\nrecorded on chain: evidence,\nnot silence",
