   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "text": "one EIP-712 signature,\nbound to that exact\nrequest hash, usable once\n\nthe approval WIDENS the\nband; it never removes it\n\na human may authorise\npaying more than usual.\nNobody may authorise\npaying an unpriced amount.",
   "originalText": "one EIP-712 signature,\nbound to that exact\nrequest hash, usable once\n\nthe approval WIDENS the\nband; it never removes it\n\na human may authorise\npaying more than usual.\nNobody may authorise\npaying an unpriced amount.",
